The '''Ombakond sector''' was a [[sector]] in [[the galaxy]]'s [[Expansion Region]].<ref name="Appendix" /> It contained the [[desert]] [[planet]] [[Pasaana]], [[homeworld]] of the [[Aki-Aki]] [[species]].<ref name="TROS VD" />

{{Sec-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The entry for the [[Middian system]] in the "[[Star Systems of the Galaxy]]" appendix published in [[June]] [[2025]] lists the Ombakond sector (misspelled as Ombakand) as a subsector of the [[Altier sector]], though the sector is not listed as such for any of the other systems in the Ombakand sector.<ref name="Appendix" /> The appendix's author [[Jason Fry]] indicated that this was an error, and that Pasaana would either be kept in the Altier sector, or its placement on the [[Star Wars Galaxy Map|''Star Wars'' Galaxy Map]] would be adjusted to put it correctly in the Ombakond sector.<ref name="Fry">{{EmailCite|email=File:AtlasEmail-2025-09-03.png|creator=[[Jason Fry]]|date=2025-09-03}}</ref>

